WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.240
Three times a day, many Jews stand
with feet together, facing Jerusalem.

2
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:08.670
They say the same prayer
silently, lips moving,

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.460
as Hannah once prayed.

4
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:16.300
Centuries ago, the thinker Maimonides ranked
acts of giving on a ladder of 8 levels.

5
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.850
At the very top: helping
someone find a job.

6
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.430
Why pray the same words every day?

7
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.170
And why would the best gift be a job?

8
00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.550
In this mission, you'll build the Amidah,

9
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.560
the standing prayer, blessing by blessing.

10
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.930
Then you'll climb Maimonides'
ladder, rung by rung,

11
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.200
and test where gifts belong.

12
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.640
Your mission: find out why Jews
repeat the same prayer each day,

13
00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:42.680
and what makes a gift the best.
